      "text": "rank(X*(A.weight)^T(B.weight)^T) ≤ min(rank(x),rank(B.weight*A*weight)) ≤\nmin(rank(x),rank(B.weight),rank(A.weight)) ≤ min(in,rank) = rank 容量受限，不容易overfitting",
