      "index": "c0RX",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1847810785,
      "version": 1716,
      "versionNonce": 510700387,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795090190430,
      "created": 1794507655805,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "图只代表走向，大小比例仅供参考！真实的大模型l和w的比例和图中演示的比例不一致，但各阶段的走向完全一致！\n大模型在上下文很长的时候，通常保存的激活值(15l)总量远大于梯度(w)，这时候前向传播结束为峰值，和图中不符是因为图里的比例问题。",
      "fontSize": 16.56234080656737,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "图只代表走向，大小比例仅供参考！真实的大模型l和w的比例和图中演示的比例不一致，但各阶段的走向完全一致！\n大模型在上下文很长的时候，通常保存的激活值(15l)总量远大于梯度(w)，这时候前向传播结束为峰值，和图中不符是因为图里的比例问题。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "O0sxM8JhdXRy85eGLUztk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8749.521939361202,
      "y": -880.7446326083921,
      "width": 583.2129390905786,
      "height": 37.98244844839839,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0RY",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 980690716,
      "version": 1942,
      "versionNonce": 639611981,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795090101792,
      "created": 1794508568827,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "正常情况下每个batch正向传播反向传播的GPU显存占用趋势图（以无权重共享、最简\n单的MLP为例，具体网络可另行具体分析，比如RNN还要考虑临时多梯度信号加和）",
      "fontSize": 15.19297937935936,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "正常情况下每个batch正向传播反向传播的GPU显存占用趋势图（以无权重共享、最简单的MLP为例，具体网络可另行具体分析，比如RNN还要考虑临时多梯度信号加和）",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "uRheFh5f52QeTC4gegJa7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9802.442674797878,
      "y": -1134.7621699273786,
      "width": 538.8696467352074,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0UE",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1263514140,
      "version": 1149,
      "versionNonce": 51182305,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794555420981,
      "created": 1794508764349,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "new_gradient_weight ≈  0.01 * weight\nnew_adam_optimizer ≈ 0.01 * 2 * weight\nnew_weight ≈ 1.01 * weight\nnew_activation_forward ≈ 1.01 * activation_forward\nnew_gradient_layer ≈ 1.01*gradient_layer（流动客不缩）",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "new_gradient_weight ≈  0.01 * weight\nnew_adam_optimizer ≈ 0.01 * 2 * weight\nnew_weight ≈ 1.01 * weight\nnew_activation_forward ≈ 1.01 * activation_forward\nnew_gradient_layer ≈ 1.01*gradient_layer（流动客不缩）",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "jWHp6Ac-ZrRijsZt_q5MJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9938.895726663819,
      "y": -962.8423712283741,
      "width": 436.6792297363281,
      "height": 124.52081606024868,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0UL",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2033176092,
      "version": 870,
      "versionNonce": 2137778147,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "BL53FzBCBqh8Am9GOmXG0",
          "type": "arrow"
        },
        {
          "id": "Yy09CcsDB3E4oPJxKvFND",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1795089977187,
      "created": 1794509182963,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "LoRA: 基本就是优化了梯度和优化器的显存 \n权重：1.01W\n梯度：0.01W\n优化器状态：0.02W\n激活值： 1.01nW（n会随着很多因素变动）\n基础显存：正向传播结束1.03W+1.01nW,反向传播结束1.04W",
      "fontSize": 16.602775474699822,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "LoRA: 基本就是优化了梯度和优化器的显存 \n权重：1.01W\n梯度：0.01W\n优化器状态：0.02W\n激活值： 1.01nW（n会随着很多因素变动）\n基础显存：正向传播结束1.03W+1.01nW,反向传播结束1.04W",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "VTp7b-RknzsQHGjG7GZ2F",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9478.487083430264,
      "y": -968.3213505717376,
      "width": 362.11212158203125,
      "height": 124.52081606024868,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0UM",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 887223580,
      "version": 1274,
      "versionNonce": 587167757,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "BL53FzBCBqh8Am9GOmXG0",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1795089970430,
      "created": 1794509192060,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "全量微调：\n权重：1W\n梯度：1W\n优化器状态：2W\n激活值： nW（n会随着很多因素变动）\n基础显存：正向传播结束3W+nW,反向传播结束4W",
      "fontSize": 16.602775474699822,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "全量微调：\n权重：1W\n梯度：1W\n优化器状态：2W\n激活值： nW（n会随着很多因素变动）\n基础显存：正向传播结束3W+nW,反向传播结束4W",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
