    {
      "id": "Cz5MlAMUbV2iDYYQUjafN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9496.68021292542,
      "y": -811.42795146563,
      "width": 866.0454928174976,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0X2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 740900892,
      "version": 2048,
      "versionNonce": 517735009,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "Yy09CcsDB3E4oPJxKvFND",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1794555420981,
      "created": 1794509710398,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "在 LoRA 中，因为base model被冻结，不需要对它们计算权重梯度，通常可以通过\nrequires_grad=False，但是还是免除不了保存正向的激活值，因为lora中有参数的梯度计算过程\n包含正向激活值。如果使用gradient checkpointing,正向传播结束1.03W+(边界数/层数)*(1.01nW)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "在 LoRA 中，因为base model被冻结，不需要对它们计算权重梯度，通常可以通过 requires_grad=False，但是还是免除不了保存正向的激活值，因为lora中有参数的梯度计算过程包含正向激活值。如果使用gradient checkpointing,正向传播结束1.03W+(边界数/层数)*(1.01nW)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Yy09CcsDB3E4oPJxKvFND",
